<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6218050859151113689..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Yoo&#39;s On First: Let The Lustration Begin!</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>5</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1718875412556753359</id><published>2008-01-09T16:14:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-09T16:14:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Lest we forget, Mr. Yoo was also had an instrument...</title><content type='html'>Lest we forget, Mr. Yoo was also had an instrumental part in creating that Ol&#39; Newspeak winner of the decade...USA PATRIOT ACT. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And the doctrine of Unitary Executive...&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Etc. Etc.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Yoo</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/1718875412556753359'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/1718875412556753359'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html?showComment=1199920440000#c1718875412556753359' title=''/><author><name>DontTreadOnMe</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6218050859151113689' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6218050859151113689' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2008 at 4:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9004561297826027562</id><published>2008-01-08T23:28:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-08T23:28:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>May the winter of our frusration be followed by th...</title><content type='html'>May the winter of our frusration be followed by the springtime of their lustration! Trouble is, both parties are in it up to their necks, and the Dems are probably loath to relinquish the new presidential powers that have been magically conjured up by the &quot;Yoohas.&quot; (Apologies to Jonathan Swift.) No, unlike the evil Sauron, the Dems will use the Ring to accomplish good! And therefore I expect the Dems to go easy on the perps and instead focus on &quot;healing&quot; instead, making full use of the imperial presidency to do so. Some &quot;healing&quot; life under the presidency of &lt;I&gt;anyone&lt;/I&gt; besides Ron Paul will turn out to be! -- it will be more of the last eight years. Sort of like being raped by a stronger cellmate in prison, maybe the American people will eventually get used it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/9004561297826027562'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/9004561297826027562'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html?showComment=1199860080000#c9004561297826027562' title=''/><author><name>Christopher Witmer</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6218050859151113689' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6218050859151113689' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2008 at 11:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-870410812663757494</id><published>2008-01-08T17:46:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-08T17:46:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I suspect Yoo&#39;s contribution to the legal philosop...</title><content type='html'>I suspect Yoo&#39;s contribution to the legal philosophy of compassionate fascism is unlikely to be found a sufficient direct or proximate cause of the victim&#39;s injuries to sustain this case.  It was Bush&#39;s decision to torture, and the torturers themselves who did it.  Yoo rises no higher than obedient charlatan - who (as your inspired historical reference points out) only rationalized what his masters already wanted.  Plame&#39;s attempt to hold the Administration liable for damages was a more plausible (if not successful) run.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I&#39;m afraid the &quot;lustration&quot; of this degenerate Administration is in the hands of the next Attorney General.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/870410812663757494'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/870410812663757494'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html?showComment=1199839560000#c870410812663757494' title=''/><author><name>Matthew Melmon</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/06919806743302840072</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6218050859151113689' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6218050859151113689' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-109825039"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 8, 2008 at 5:46 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7586647761230738810</id><published>2008-01-05T19:12:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-05T19:12:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Articles like this are why I read everything Will ...</title><content type='html'>Articles like this are why I read everything Will writes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/7586647761230738810'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/7586647761230738810'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html?showComment=1199585520000#c7586647761230738810' title=''/><author><name>Braveheart</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6218050859151113689' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6218050859151113689' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 5, 2008 at 7:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2492428457523179409</id><published>2008-01-05T10:29:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-05T10:29:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,Just a quick comment to wish you and your fam...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Just a quick comment to wish you and your family a happy, healthy and prosperous 2008. Keep up the good work. I (and I am sure many others) will keep reading.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thank you for all you are doing.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;--jorge</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/2492428457523179409'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6218050859151113689/comments/default/2492428457523179409'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html?showComment=1199554140000#c2492428457523179409' title=''/><author><name>Jorge</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/yoos-on-first-let-lustration-begin.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6218050859151113689' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6218050859151113689' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 5, 2008 at 10:29 AM"/></entry></feed>